/**
 * scripts/photos.mjs  DEV DATA (not part of the sold package)
 *
 * The photo manifest: which real photograph fills which image slot in which
 * demo. Consumed by scripts/fetch-photos.mjs.
 *
 * Source: Lorem Picsum (https://picsum.photos), which serves a fixed, curated
 * set of photographs published under the Unsplash licence  free for commercial
 * use, no attribution required. We credit the photographers anyway in
 * docs/photo-credits.md, generated by the fetch script.
 *
 * Each entry is [picsumId, width, height]. Picsum centre-crops to the requested
 * box, so the box doubles as the art direction: 4:3 for cards, 3:4 for people,
 * 16:11 for full-bleed heroes, 1:1 for avatars.
 *
 * Slots are the same eleven in every demo, so a new demo can be created by
 * copying a folder  even when a demo does not currently render all of them.
 */

